#: ../../source/use_cases.rst:217
msgid "Python: any format"
msgstr "Python：任意格式"

#: ../../source/use_cases.rst:219
msgid ""
"``pc.get_part_cadquery()`` and ``pc.get_part_build123d()`` above are thin"
" aliases for the general conversion API, which returns the result in "
"memory for any supported format instead of writing an output file:"
msgstr ""
"上面的 ``pc.get_part_cadquery()`` 和 ``pc.get_part_build123d()`` 是通用转换 API "
"的简单别名，对于任何受支持的格式，它都会在内存中返回结果，而不是写出一个输出文件："

#: ../../source/use_cases.rst:235
msgid ""
"The supported part types are ``build123d`` and ``cadquery``, which return"
" the CAD library's own object, plus the serialized formats ``3mf``, "
"``brep``, ``dxf``, ``gltf``, ``iges``, ``obj``, ``step``, ``stl``, "
"``svg`` and ``threejs``. Formats that are textual by definition "
"(``step``, ``iges``, ``brep``, ``obj``, ``threejs``, ``svg``, ``dxf``) "
"are returned as ``str``; formats that are or can be binary (``stl``, "
"``3mf``, ``gltf``) are returned as ``bytes``. The return type depends "
"only on the requested part type, never on the export options."
msgstr ""
"受支持的零件类型有 ``build123d`` 和 ``cadquery`` （它们返回相应 CAD 库自己的对象），以及序列化格式 "
"``3mf`` 、 ``brep`` 、 ``dxf`` 、 ``gltf`` 、 ``iges`` 、 ``obj`` 、 ``step`` 、"
" ``stl`` 、 ``svg`` 和 ``threejs`` 。本质上属于文本的格式（ ``step`` 、 ``iges`` 、 "
"``brep`` 、 ``obj`` 、 ``threejs`` 、 ``svg`` 、 ``dxf`` ）会以 ``str`` "
"形式返回；本身是或可能是二进制的格式（ ``stl`` 、 ``3mf`` 、 ``gltf`` ）则以 ``bytes`` "
"形式返回。返回类型仅取决于所请求的零件类型，而与导出选项无关。"

#: ../../source/use_cases.rst:244
msgid ""
"``pc.convert_assembly()`` and ``pc.convert_sketch()`` do the same for "
"assemblies and sketches, and ``Shape.convert()`` is available directly on"
" any part, sketch or assembly object."
msgstr ""
"``pc.convert_assembly()`` 和 ``pc.convert_sketch()`` 对装配体和草图执行同样的操作，而 "
"``Shape.convert()`` 可直接在任意零件、草图或装配体对象上调用。"

